	)
	(text_box "the main processor running the whole phone. C14-C19 (4.7µF + six 100nF) are decoupling caps, one set per VDD pin, since the H7 has multiple internal power domains that each need local filtering. NRST+C20 (100nF) filters the reset line so noise doesn't accidentally reset the chip. BOOT0+R20 (10k) sets which memory the chip boots from on power-up. VCAP+C25/C26 (2.2µF) feed the MCU's internal core regulator - required by ST's datasheet, not optional."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 311.15 -16.51 0)
		(size 55.88 24.13)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
