	(text_box "he physical link between your main PCB and the secondary mobile-module PCB. Every signal that needs to cross the stack goes through here - modem power/reset/wake, audio, UART, SIM lines, plus raw battery voltage and +1.8V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 80.01 -2.54 0)
		(size 55.88 11.43)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
